# Maintainer: ArchMage contributors
#
# ArchMage pacman keyring(UPDATE-03 双通道仓库的信任锚,03-03 Task 3;
# 仿 archlinuxcn-keyring 模式):
#   - /usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archmage.gpg       stable 签名公钥集合
#   - /usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archmage-trusted   populate 信任指纹清单
#
# archmage.gpg 由人工签名仪式产出(tools/repo/export-keyring.sh,维护者
# 宿主机上执行;docs/REPO-CHANNELS.md)。仓库提交态在仪式前不含该文件
# —— 这不是桩,而是「密钥不进自动化」的机械表达:.gitignore 锁定 +
# .ci-defer 把本包挡在 CI staging 构建之外,仪式产出密钥后由维护者
# 删除 .ci-defer 提交,CI 才开始分发本包(经 testing/stable 自更新路径
# 见 docs/REPO-CHANNELS.md §keyring)。
#
# rotation(密钥轮换)流程规划于 Phase 4;本包结构就绪,等待仪式。

pkgname=archmage-keyring
pkgver=1
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc='ArchMage pacman keyring: stable channel trust anchor (populated via pacman-key)'
arch=(any)
url='https://github.com/uMaj35ty/ArchMage'
license=('MIT')
depends=('pacman')
install=archmage-keyring.install
source=('archmage.gpg'
        'archmage-trusted')
# archmage.gpg: SKIP —— 该文件由离线仪式产出后打包,密钥本身即信任锚,
# 没有更上游的签名者可校验;其真实性与出处由仪式文档的人工步骤保证。
sha256sums=('SKIP'
            '7fdee615612b070e029730a031fe79e05d6989a9f0ddc7618bc0eff894fa14aa')

package() {
    install -Dm644 archmage.gpg \
        "$pkgdir/usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archmage.gpg"
    install -Dm644 archmage-trusted \
        "$pkgdir/usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archmage-trusted"

    install -d "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/$pkgname"
    cat > "$pkgdir/usr/share/doc/$pkgname/README" <<'EOF'
ArchMage keyring(archmage-keyring)
===================================

随包分发:

  /usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archmage.gpg       ArchMage stable 签名公钥
  /usr/share/pacman/keyrings/archmage-trusted   信任指纹清单

post_install/post_upgrade 执行 `pacman-key --populate archmage`:导入公钥
并对 trusted 清单里的指纹做本机签名(ultimate trust)。此后客户端对
[archmage-stable] / [archmage-testing] 通道的 SigLevel Required 校验
不需要任何手工 key 操作。

密钥与仪式:
  - stable 签名密钥由维护者在离线介质上生成(离线主键 + 签名子键),
    公钥经 tools/repo/export-keyring.sh 导出成本包输入;
  - 仪式逐条步骤见 docs/REPO-CHANNELS.md;私钥永不接触任何自动化
    (CI/runner/本包构建);
  - 密钥轮换(rotation)流程规划于 Phase 4。
EOF
}
